+# AUTO-007 frozen future-build rubric
+
+These are requirements for a future build, never passing evidence. AUTO-007 starts missing with empty Evidence. AUTO-001 remains deferred under RL-101; this rubric does not reopen its attempt or transfer proof from either gated source.
+
+R1 realistic Member series creation in teamA, Owner move of prior occurrence to private teamB, Member issueGET404;
+
+R2 scheduled export and native series-history read while hidden-open then hidden-completed, compare operator-visible outcomes for indistinguishability with populated private records unchanged;
+
+R3 owner/currently-authorized team-member positive controls retain accurate history/links/normal recurrence, unauthorized doors refuse without effects;
+
+R4 Settings history at1440/390 plus durable restart/replay preserve safe projection and once-only effects.
